a the cook","look":"marta","x":4103,"y":8416,"shop":"castle_kitchen","examine":"Marta, who has cooked for the castle since before the castellan had his keys."},{"id":"castle_qm","name":"Quartermaster Hale","look":"hale","x":4086,"y":8434,"shop":"castle_general","examine":"Quartermaster Hale. Rope, nets, tinderboxes, bread: if the castle needs it, he counts it."},{"id":"castle_armourer","name":"Armourer Voss","look":"voss","x":4082,"y":8412,"shop":"castle_armoury","examine":"Armourer Voss, who keeps the watch in bowstrings and the gate guard in rivets."},{"id":"castellan","name":"Castellan Brannoc","look":"brannoc","guard":true,"maxHit":10,"gear":{"weapon":"longsword_t2"},"x":4067,"y":8393,"examine":"Castellan Brannoc, keeper of the lake castle. He has the keys, and he has had them for a long time.","lines":["The lake keeps this place better than the walls do. Nobody comes at a castle across a mile of cold water.","The keep is shut while the masons finish the stair. Walk the walls if you like; the steps are by the corners."]},{"id":"gate_guard","name":"Gate guard","look":"ash_knight","guard":true,"maxHit":8,"gear":{"weapon":"sword_t3","shield":"shield_t2","head":"helmet_t2"},"x":4042,"y":8443,"examine":"A guard at the castle gate, leaning on a spear he has not needed in years.","lines":["Welcome to the lake castle. Mind the gatehouse, the portcullis sticks."]},{"id":"watch_w1","name":"Watchman","look":"ash_knight","guard":true,"maxHit":6,"x":4024,"y":8439,"patrol":[[4024,8439],[4023,8439],[4022,8439],[4022,8440],[4022,8441],[4022,8442],[4022,8443],[4023,8443],[4024,8443],[4025,8443],[4026,8443],[4026,8442],[4027,8442],[4027,8441],[4028,8441]],"gear":{"weapon":"bow_t2","ammo":"arrows_t1","head":"helmet_t2"},"examine":"A watchman on the castle wall, bow strung, walking his round and looking out over the water.","lines":["Nothing on the lake today. There never is. That is the job.","If you came over the water, I would have seen you an hour ago."]},{"id":"watch_w2","name